[{"text": "The assembly will hear an address by her", "start": 4.96, "duration": 6.559}, {"text": "excellency Jennifer Gearing Simons,", "start": 7.68, "duration": 7.2}, {"text": "President of the Republic of Surinim. I", "start": 11.519, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "request the protocol to escort her", "start": 14.88, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "excellency and invite her to address the", "start": 17.119, "duration": 6.201}, {"text": "assembly.", "start": 20.32, "duration": 3.0}, {"text": "Mr. President, Secretary General,", "start": 38.48, "duration": 4.48}, {"text": "excellencies,", "start": 41.28, "duration": 3.92}, {"text": "distinguished delegates, ladies and", "start": 42.96, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "gentlemen.", "start": 45.2, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "Mr. President, let me congratulate you", "start": 47.6, "duration": 4.959}, {"text": "on the assumption of the high office of", "start": 49.84, "duration": 5.039}, {"text": "President of the 81st session of the", "start": 52.559, "duration": 6.16}, {"text": "General Assembly of the United Nations.", "start": 54.879, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "Expressing appreciation to your", "start": 58.719, "duration": 5.201}, {"text": "predecessor for her stewardship of the", "start": 60.559, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "80th session of the General Assembly and", "start": 63.92, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "I wish her every success in her future", "start": 66.799, "duration": 5.041}, {"text": "endeavors.", "start": 69.68, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "Secretary General,", "start": 71.84, "duration": 4.639}, {"text": "as you approach the conclusion of your", "start": 74.24, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "tenure, the Republic of Surinama", "start": 76.479, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "commenced the dedicated service to", "start": 79.52, "duration": 3.44}, {"text": "humanity", "start": 81.439, "duration": 4.32}, {"text": "showcased while in office.", "start": 82.96, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "We also remember with warmth your visit", "start": 85.759, "duration": 5.521}, {"text": "to Surinama, expressing the importance", "start": 87.92, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "of the United Nations engagement with", "start": 91.28, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "our country and the Caribbean region. We", "start": 93.6, "duration": 8.08}, {"text": "wish you well in the part before you.", "start": 97.28, "duration": 6.4}, {"text": "Mr. President,", "start": 101.68, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "standing before this assembly, I am", "start": 103.68, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "reminded that while some efforts have", "start": 106.96, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "been made from this rostroom over the", "start": 110.24, "duration": 4.239}, {"text": "past year,", "start": 112.64, "duration": 4.24}, {"text": "these have not yet matched the scale of", "start": 114.479, "duration": 6.481}, {"text": "the challenges confronting our world.", "start": 116.88, "duration": 6.4}, {"text": "We will have to increase and strengthen", "start": 120.96, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "efforts and commitment to the process of", "start": 123.28, "duration": 5.679}, {"text": "transformation and strengthening of the", "start": 126.32, "duration": 6.559}, {"text": "UN in order to restore trust", "start": 128.959, "duration": 6.881}, {"text": "that our organization will really be", "start": 132.879, "duration": 6.161}, {"text": "capable of delivering peace, inclusion", "start": 135.84, "duration": 7.64}, {"text": "and development in the world.", "start": 139.04, "duration": 4.44}, {"text": "Surinama is firmly committed to the", "start": 143.52, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "upholding of international law as we", "start": 145.599, "duration": 5.921}, {"text": "depend on a rule-based international", "start": 149.2, "duration": 6.319}, {"text": "order without which like many other", "start": 151.52, "duration": 6.719}, {"text": "vulnerable nations we simply cannot", "start": 155.519, "duration": 6.321}, {"text": "exist as sovereign countries.", "start": 158.239, "duration": 5.521}, {"text": "The consistent application of", "start": 161.84, "duration": 4.479}, {"text": "international law and the strengthening", "start": 163.76, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "of its institutions is also essential to", "start": 166.319, "duration": 5.441}, {"text": "maintain international peace and", "start": 169.76, "duration": 3.839}, {"text": "security.", "start": 171.76, "duration": 4.559}, {"text": "protect human rights and ensure", "start": 173.599, "duration": 7.28}, {"text": "sustainable development for all.", "start": 176.319, "duration": 7.84}, {"text": "Mr. President, as mentioned before, the", "start": 180.879, "duration": 5.761}, {"text": "international community is is", "start": 184.159, "duration": 5.681}, {"text": "experiencing profound uncertainty", "start": 186.64, "duration": 5.519}, {"text": "including energy and food security", "start": 189.84, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "crisis leading to intensified", "start": 192.159, "duration": 6.641}, {"text": "displacement of many people globally.", "start": 195.04, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "Armed conflict continue to claim", "start": 198.8, "duration": 5.359}, {"text": "innocent lives while geopolitical", "start": 201.36, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "tensions escalate.", "start": 204.159, "duration": 4.961}, {"text": "Children are living through unimaginable", "start": 206.48, "duration": 4.399}, {"text": "horrors.", "start": 209.12, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "The United Nations has not been able to", "start": 210.879, "duration": 8.481}, {"text": "prevent this or to end the continuation", "start": 213.68, "duration": 8.639}, {"text": "and we have to ponder on that. Other", "start": 219.36, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "developments, for example, in the street", "start": 222.319, "duration": 6.081}, {"text": "of Hormus, demonstrate how quickly wars", "start": 224.48, "duration": 6.96}, {"text": "can affect energy markets, suddenly and", "start": 228.4, "duration": 6.16}, {"text": "steeply increasing the cost of energy,", "start": 231.44, "duration": 5.84}, {"text": "adversely impacting economic and social", "start": 234.56, "duration": 6.64}, {"text": "development in our countries.", "start": 237.28, "duration": 6.08}, {"text": "Common people suffer when food and", "start": 241.2, "duration": 5.599}, {"text": "energy prices rise. So the quality of", "start": 243.36, "duration": 5.439}, {"text": "life of our people is directly", "start": 246.799, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "threatened even by wars in regions far", "start": 248.799, "duration": 6.921}, {"text": "from their homes", "start": 252.239, "duration": 3.481}, {"text": "and we as government we have to make", "start": 256.56, "duration": 6.8}, {"text": "sure that we try to protect them.", "start": 259.199, "duration": 6.801}, {"text": "Surinawa therefore calls for a renewed", "start": 263.36, "duration": 4.559}, {"text": "commitment to the purposes and", "start": 266.0, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "principles of the UN charter, namely the", "start": 267.919, "duration": 8.121}, {"text": "peaceful resolution of disputes.", "start": 271.6, "duration": 4.44}, {"text": "Dialogue is paramount for safeguarding a", "start": 277.28, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "solid and proven UN system.", "start": 280.32, "duration": 7.84}, {"text": "The people of Cuba, a Caribbean country,", "start": 283.84, "duration": 6.799}, {"text": "are adversely affected by the current", "start": 288.16, "duration": 6.319}, {"text": "situation in their country.", "start": 290.639, "duration": 6.401}, {"text": "Surinama calls on the parties involved", "start": 294.479, "duration": 5.361}, {"text": "to remain committed to dialogue and", "start": 297.04, "duration": 4.719}, {"text": "negotiation", "start": 299.84, "duration": 4.48}, {"text": "to end the economic, commercial and", "start": 301.759, "duration": 5.361}, {"text": "financial embargo. We plea for", "start": 304.32, "duration": 5.599}, {"text": "continuing of negotiations in order to", "start": 307.12, "duration": 5.519}, {"text": "prevent further escalation", "start": 309.919, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "and to reach a resolution that will", "start": 312.639, "duration": 6.161}, {"text": "benefit the people of Cuba.", "start": 315.039, "duration": 6.081}, {"text": "We also call for sustained international", "start": 318.8, "duration": 4.959}, {"text": "support for Haiti to restore security,", "start": 321.12, "duration": 4.639}, {"text": "constitutional order and democratic", "start": 323.759, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "governance. Surinama supports solutions", "start": 325.759, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "that place the Haitian people at the", "start": 329.039, "duration": 5.16}, {"text": "center.", "start": 331.199, "duration": 3.0}, {"text": "DNA process rightly emphasizes mandate", "start": 334.24, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "rationalization,", "start": 337.919, "duration": 5.441}, {"text": "institutional coherence and efficiency.", "start": 339.52, "duration": 6.72}, {"text": "Reform must protect and improve the", "start": 343.36, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "United Nations capacity to deliver and", "start": 346.24, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "also make the system easier to navigate.", "start": 349.28, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "It should not reduce support where it is", "start": 352.24, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "most needed.", "start": 354.88, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "Equally important is the overdue reform", "start": 357.84, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "of the security council. Hence, Surinama", "start": 361.12, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "reiterates its call for making it more", "start": 364.08, "duration": 5.679}, {"text": "representative, more accountable and", "start": 366.72, "duration": 6.479}, {"text": "more capable of acting.", "start": 369.759, "duration": 6.16}, {"text": "Africa, the Republic of Surinama", "start": 373.199, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "supports your demand for just permanent", "start": 375.919, "duration": 4.481}, {"text": "representation.", "start": 378.319, "duration": 4.32}, {"text": "Likewise, we underscore the relevance of", "start": 380.4, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "a dedicated representation for small", "start": 382.639, "duration": 6.4}, {"text": "island states and low lowlying coastal", "start": 385.52, "duration": 6.48}, {"text": "development states developing states.", "start": 389.039, "duration": 6.081}, {"text": "Mr. President,", "start": 392.0, "duration": 6.479}, {"text": "regional and international partnerships", "start": 395.12, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "remain indispensable to achieve our", "start": 398.479, "duration": 5.761}, {"text": "economic and so social objectives as", "start": 400.8, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "Surinama continues to actively engage in", "start": 404.24, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "various regional bodies and mechanisms", "start": 407.12, "duration": 7.12}, {"text": "including KCOM, SELAC, Ato and the", "start": 410.8, "duration": 6.64}, {"text": "Brazilia consensus.", "start": 414.24, "duration": 6.079}, {"text": "Assurinama prepares to be the chair of", "start": 417.44, "duration": 7.12}, {"text": "the Caribbean community kiccom in 2027.", "start": 420.319, "duration": 6.16}, {"text": "We are also committed to further", "start": 424.56, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "strengthen our partnership globally in", "start": 426.479, "duration": 6.481}, {"text": "different areas of shared interest.", "start": 429.12, "duration": 6.079}, {"text": "Origional priorities", "start": 432.96, "duration": 4.48}, {"text": "are practical.", "start": 435.199, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "Food and energy security,", "start": 437.44, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "climate resilience,", "start": 440.639, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "improved connectivity and movement of", "start": 442.88, "duration": 5.759}, {"text": "skilled people, transportation of goods", "start": 445.599, "duration": 6.16}, {"text": "and services. These are essential to", "start": 448.639, "duration": 6.481}, {"text": "economic integration and our ability to", "start": 451.759, "duration": 7.361}, {"text": "withstand external shocks.", "start": 455.12, "duration": 6.479}, {"text": "Mr. president. The pursuit of", "start": 459.12, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "restorative justice gained new momentum", "start": 461.599, "duration": 5.281}, {"text": "with the adoption of the resolution on", "start": 464.56, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "slavery and transatlantic trafficking of", "start": 466.88, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "enslaved Africans in this hall in March", "start": 470.08, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "of this year.", "start": 473.44, "duration": 4.319}, {"text": "This development is relevant for", "start": 476.08, "duration": 3.2}, {"text": "Surinama", "start": 477.759, "duration": 3.84}, {"text": "and equally important for the countries", "start": 479.28, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "of the Caribbean region.", "start": 481.599, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "The discussion is no longer about", "start": 484.72, "duration": 5.599}, {"text": "whether slavery and colonialism have", "start": 487.199, "duration": 6.641}, {"text": "caused lasting consequences,", "start": 490.319, "duration": 5.921}, {"text": "negative consequences.", "start": 493.84, "duration": 6.4}, {"text": "We know we are living them. We", "start": 496.24, "duration": 6.399}, {"text": "increasingly must focus on how to", "start": 500.24, "duration": 5.04}, {"text": "overcome these effects and on the", "start": 502.639, "duration": 5.041}, {"text": "question of what form reparation should", "start": 505.28, "duration": 6.879}, {"text": "take to achieve that.", "start": 507.68, "duration": 6.88}, {"text": "how countries that have benefited from", "start": 512.159, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "slavery and colonialism will compensate", "start": 514.56, "duration": 4.719}, {"text": "the effect.", "start": 517.279, "duration": 5.281}, {"text": "That is the important issue now. It is", "start": 519.279, "duration": 5.521}, {"text": "therefore that the KarCom 10point plan", "start": 522.56, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "for restorative justice is now of", "start": 524.8, "duration": 6.039}, {"text": "eminent importance.", "start": 527.12, "duration": 3.719}, {"text": "Mr. President, Surinama occupies a", "start": 533.279, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "unique position.", "start": 536.959, "duration": 5.281}, {"text": "We are carbon negative and remain the", "start": 539.279, "duration": 5.601}, {"text": "world's most forested country with over", "start": 542.24, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "90% forest coverage.", "start": 544.88, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "High forested and low deforestation", "start": 548.8, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "countries like Surinama", "start": 551.2, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "should not first have to lose forests", "start": 553.44, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "before climate finance institution", "start": 556.72, "duration": 6.08}, {"text": "recognize the value of protecting them.", "start": 559.04, "duration": 7.28}, {"text": "Conservation costs cannot be borne only", "start": 562.8, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "by the countries protecting ecosystems", "start": 566.32, "duration": 6.639}, {"text": "whose benefits are shared globally.", "start": 569.04, "duration": 6.72}, {"text": "So I will continue my plea for just and", "start": 572.959, "duration": 5.921}, {"text": "effective climate finance", "start": 575.76, "duration": 5.519}, {"text": "because our forests are under even more", "start": 578.88, "duration": 4.16}, {"text": "pressure than when I addressed this", "start": 581.279, "duration": 4.24}, {"text": "meeting last year.", "start": 583.04, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "I stated that the forest faces", "start": 585.519, "duration": 5.361}, {"text": "competition of rich national resources", "start": 588.32, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "like gold, diamonds and other precious", "start": 590.88, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "minerals.", "start": 593.92, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "We are now confronted however with a new", "start": 596.64, "duration": 6.879}, {"text": "threat of people who also want to clear", "start": 600.24, "duration": 5.84}, {"text": "parts of our rainforest for largecale", "start": 603.519, "duration": 5.561}, {"text": "agriculture.", "start": 606.08, "duration": 3.0}, {"text": "We will need to prevent that and we can", "start": 610.16, "duration": 5.04}, {"text": "use every assistance.", "start": 612.56, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "At this very moment, my government is", "start": 615.2, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "introducing legal and institutional", "start": 617.68, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "measures to better protect our forests", "start": 620.16, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "and the immediate living environment of", "start": 623.68, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "indigenous people and tribal", "start": 625.92, "duration": 4.08}, {"text": "communities.", "start": 628.24, "duration": 4.0}, {"text": "Their knowledge and participation are", "start": 630.0, "duration": 7.079}, {"text": "important at all stages of development.", "start": 632.24, "duration": 4.839}, {"text": "Last year at this restroom, I noted that", "start": 637.6, "duration": 6.88}, {"text": "Surinama is diversity.", "start": 640.64, "duration": 6.4}, {"text": "And at a time when diversity is too", "start": 644.48, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "often manipulated as a source of", "start": 647.04, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "division, Surinama has chosen the path", "start": 649.36, "duration": 5.599}, {"text": "to recognize the distinct histories of", "start": 652.48, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "its people while strengthening their", "start": 654.959, "duration": 5.761}, {"text": "unity and their shared responsibility", "start": 657.92, "duration": 7.52}, {"text": "for the future. Our experience affirms", "start": 660.72, "duration": 7.28}, {"text": "that diversity when grounded in", "start": 665.44, "duration": 6.16}, {"text": "equality, mutual respect and meaningful", "start": 668.0, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "participation", "start": 671.6, "duration": 5.84}, {"text": "is not an adversity. It is a source of", "start": 673.92, "duration": 7.599}, {"text": "national resilience and prosperity.", "start": 677.44, "duration": 7.2}, {"text": "Last month, the Republic of Surinama", "start": 681.519, "duration": 6.241}, {"text": "observed its first heritage month under", "start": 684.64, "duration": 6.36}, {"text": "the theme", "start": 687.76, "duration": 3.24}, {"text": "meaning as much as however we came here", "start": 693.839, "duration": 7.601}, {"text": "united we move forward.", "start": 698.16, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "This initiative was conceived not merely", "start": 701.44, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "to celebrate our culture and the", "start": 703.76, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "diversity in it but as a deliberate", "start": 706.72, "duration": 6.16}, {"text": "national undertaking centered on growing", "start": 709.68, "duration": 8.0}, {"text": "inclusion, mutual respect and unity", "start": 712.88, "duration": 8.0}, {"text": "and this process is also relevant for", "start": 717.68, "duration": 6.92}, {"text": "the global community.", "start": 720.88, "duration": 3.72}, {"text": "Mr. President, the development of", "start": 724.959, "duration": 5.601}, {"text": "Surinama's offshore natural resources,", "start": 727.519, "duration": 5.841}, {"text": "including oil and gas, will present", "start": 730.56, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "significant", "start": 733.36, "duration": 4.4}, {"text": "opportunities to accelerate national", "start": 735.2, "duration": 4.4}, {"text": "development", "start": 737.76, "duration": 3.68}, {"text": "and improve the well-being of our", "start": 739.6, "duration": 4.239}, {"text": "people.", "start": 741.44, "duration": 5.519}, {"text": "Yet, we are equally conscious that oil", "start": 743.839, "duration": 6.321}, {"text": "and gas cannot and should not become the", "start": 746.959, "duration": 7.12}, {"text": "only foundation of our economy. Our", "start": 750.16, "duration": 6.08}, {"text": "approach is therefore clear. We must", "start": 754.079, "duration": 5.521}, {"text": "transform temporary resource wealth into", "start": 756.24, "duration": 6.159}, {"text": "lasting national prosperity", "start": 759.6, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "using resource revenues strategically to", "start": 762.399, "duration": 6.321}, {"text": "strengthen our economy and make it more", "start": 765.92, "duration": 6.719}, {"text": "resilient through diversification.", "start": 768.72, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "Additionally, we will need to improve", "start": 772.639, "duration": 4.961}, {"text": "our energy security.", "start": 775.04, "duration": 4.799}, {"text": "And although we are preparing for gas to", "start": 777.6, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "shore and gas to energy, renewable", "start": 779.839, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "energy will be part of our national", "start": 782.48, "duration": 7.28}, {"text": "energy mix. Mr. President, beside the", "start": 785.279, "duration": 8.24}, {"text": "expected economic and energy transition,", "start": 789.76, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "we must also prepare for the", "start": 793.519, "duration": 3.681}, {"text": "transformation", "start": 795.68, "duration": 6.04}, {"text": "driven by artificial intelligence.", "start": 797.2, "duration": 4.52}, {"text": "But only if we can implement", "start": 801.839, "duration": 7.041}, {"text": "AI responsibly and control, Surinama", "start": 805.44, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "will be able to benefit from the", "start": 808.88, "duration": 4.959}, {"text": "opportunities of this technology and", "start": 811.2, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "mitigate its risks.", "start": 813.839, "duration": 7.961}, {"text": "So we are preparing for that.", "start": 817.44, "duration": 4.36}, {"text": "Coming back to the United Nations,", "start": 823.12, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "with only four years left to achieve the", "start": 826.079, "duration": 5.681}, {"text": "sustainable development goals,", "start": 828.88, "duration": 5.199}, {"text": "we may question", "start": 831.76, "duration": 5.439}, {"text": "whether we were too ambitious or if we", "start": 834.079, "duration": 6.641}, {"text": "should have done much more.", "start": 837.199, "duration": 5.681}, {"text": "Political will,", "start": 840.72, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "international peace and accelerated", "start": 842.88, "duration": 6.16}, {"text": "implementation are required,", "start": 846.24, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "supported by financing, technology and", "start": 849.04, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "partnerships that produce measurable", "start": 851.92, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "results.", "start": 855.04, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "Equally important is it to have a", "start": 857.6, "duration": 4.16}, {"text": "mechanism in place for global", "start": 859.92, "duration": 6.279}, {"text": "commitments after 2030.", "start": 861.76, "duration": 4.439}, {"text": "Mr. President, excellencies,", "start": 867.44, "duration": 4.24}, {"text": "distinguished delegates.", "start": 869.44, "duration": 6.079}, {"text": "Finally, as the UN, the United Nations", "start": 871.68, "duration": 5.599}, {"text": "approaches change in its highest", "start": 875.519, "duration": 3.361}, {"text": "leadership,", "start": 877.279, "duration": 4.081}, {"text": "current realities and approved mandates", "start": 878.88, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "require the next secretary general to", "start": 881.36, "duration": 5.279}, {"text": "portray strong commitment to", "start": 884.8, "duration": 3.76}, {"text": "multilateralism,", "start": 886.639, "duration": 6.081}, {"text": "dialogue, and the rule of law.", "start": 888.56, "duration": 6.88}, {"text": "Many capable candidates including women", "start": 892.72, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "leaders who have taken up the challenge", "start": 895.44, "duration": 5.519}, {"text": "have been put forth and for the first", "start": 898.32, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "time in history we have a female", "start": 900.959, "duration": 5.521}, {"text": "candidate from the Caribbean.", "start": 904.0, "duration": 4.24}, {"text": "Kiccom", "start": 906.48, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "endorses this candidate.", "start": 908.24, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "We are at that time in history", "start": 911.68, "duration": 6.88}, {"text": "where trust in the United Nations", "start": 914.8, "duration": 7.92}, {"text": "must urgently be restored.", "start": 918.56, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "We make efforts.", "start": 922.72, "duration": 7.479}, {"text": "Surinama is that to protect our forest.", "start": 924.88, "duration": 5.319}, {"text": "We use our natural wealth responsibly.", "start": 930.32, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "We want to strengthen the Caribbean", "start": 933.04, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "community and promote dialogue.", "start": 935.12, "duration": 8.399}, {"text": "We Surinama will do what we can", "start": 938.48, "duration": 7.68}, {"text": "and we call on the more influential", "start": 943.519, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "members of the United Nations", "start": 946.16, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "to help maintain peace to make sure that", "start": 949.199, "duration": 6.961}, {"text": "there is peace in the world because only", "start": 952.48, "duration": 7.12}, {"text": "a United Nations capable of safeguarding", "start": 956.16, "duration": 6.4}, {"text": "international peace and security will", "start": 959.6, "duration": 5.359}, {"text": "deliver for all.", "start": 962.56, "duration": 7.8}, {"text": "I thank you Granti. May God bless you.", "start": 964.959, "duration": 5.401}, {"text": "On behalf of the assembly, I wish thank", "start": 977.839, "duration": 7.401}, {"text": "the president of Republic of Surinam.", "start": 980.56, "duration": 4.68}]